              "content": "=You are an invoice data extraction system.\n\nExtract structured invoice information from the following document text.\n\nReturn ONLY valid JSON using exactly this structure:\n\n{\n  \"invoice_number\": \"\",\n  \"invoice_date\": \"\",\n  \"due_date\": \"\",\n  \"vendor_name\": \"\",\n  \"vendor_address\": \"\",\n  \"customer_name\": \"\",\n  \"customer_address\": \"\",\n  \"subtotal\": 0,\n  \"tax\": 0,\n  \"total_amount\": 0,\n  \"currency\": \"\",\n  \"payment_terms\": \"\",\n  \"items\": [\n    {\n      \"description\": \"\",\n      \"quantity\": 0,\n      \"unit_price\": 0,\n      \"total\": 0\n    }\n  ]\n}\n\nRules:\n- Extract values only from the document text.\n- Do not invent or assume information.\n- Use numbers for quantity, unit_price, subtotal, tax, and total_amount.\n- Do not include currency symbols inside numeric fields.\n- Preserve the invoice number exactly.\n- Return JSON only.\n- No markdown.\n- No explanation.\n\nDOCUMENT TEXT:\n\n{{ $json.text }}"
